{
  "description": "Per-agent and per-gardener spend for the autonomous (dark) fleet, keyed to the real LiteLLM bill (gardenio_agent_spend_usd_total / gardenio_agent_spend_logs_usd). Scope with the project variable (default monorepo-dark, matching the DarkSpendOverThreshold alert's projectRegex). The dark series are NOT yet federated into gardenio-vmsingle (ka-0000005942 / ka-0000005346), so panels read empty today — empty is not $0, and the project variable is a literal textbox precisely so this board can never silently fall back to whole-fleet spend under a Dark title.",
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "name": "gardenio rollout",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": false,
        "iconColor": "semi-dark-orange",
        "expr": "count(changes(process_start_time_seconds{namespace=\"gardenio-system\",component!=\"\"}[$__interval]) > 0) >= 3",
        "step": "1m",
        "titleFormat": "gardenio rollout",
        "textFormat": "3+ gardenio-system components restarted at once - a release deploy or chart apply. Check this marker before hunting a code cause for a step change on this board."
      },
      {
        "name": "component restart",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "enable": false,
        "hide": false,
        "iconColor": "semi-dark-blue",
        "expr": "changes(process_start_time_seconds{namespace=\"gardenio-system\",component!=\"\"}[$__interval]) > 0",
        "step": "1m",
        "tagKeys": "component",
        "titleFormat": "{{component}} restarted",
        "textFormat": "gardenio-system/{{component}} moved its process start time - deploy, OOM-kill or crash-loop. Off by default: ~22 single-component restarts/day fleet-wide would bury the rollout markers."
      }
    ]
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "All gardenio boards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "gardenio"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "targetBlank": false,
      "tooltip": "Every gardenio board, with this board's time range carried over"
    },
    {
      "title": "Cost overview",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/grafana/d/gardenio-cost-overview",
      "icon": "external link",
      "tooltip": "Per-agent / per-project / per-model spend - the bill this board's numbers roll up into",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "X-check trust",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/grafana/d/gardenio-xcheck-trust",
      "icon": "external link",
      "tooltip": "Whether the two independent derivations of each cost agree - is the number above trustworthy at all",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "operated_by attribution",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/grafana/d/kbeads-operated-by",
      "icon": "external link",
      "tooltip": "Which human every bead write and every dollar is attributed to",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this board",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "> ⚠ **Pending dark-metric federation — empty is NOT $0.** The `monorepo-dark` series is **not yet federated** into `gardenio-vmsingle` (tracked in ka-0000005942 / ka-0000005346), so every panel below reads **empty**: the dark fleet's spend is not scraped here yet, which is not the same as zero spend. The un-federated rows are **collapsed by default** — expand one to check whether federation has landed.\n\n**Dark spend** — per-agent and per-gardener token/$ spend for the autonomous (dark) fleet, from the **litellm-cost-tracking** family (`gardenio_agent_spend_usd_total`, fed from LiteLLM spend logs by the controller `tag_spend_sync` daemon). The **project** variable is a literal textbox (never a `label_values` query), so this board can **never silently fall back to `project=All`**. Set **threshold** to the USD/hour value `DarkSpendOverThreshold` uses, to preview where it fires. This board **observes** only."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Dark fleet spend — overview",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Dark spend (window · real bill)",
      "description": "Total LiteLLM spend for the selected fleet over the dashboard time range (increase of the per-agent spend counter). This is the same billed dollars per-agent settlement books.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "noValue": "pending dark-metric federation (empty ≠ $0) — ka-0000005942",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(gardenio_agent_spend_usd_total{project=~\"$project\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Dark spend rate (USD/hour · real bill)",
      "description": "Trailing-1h spend rate for the selected fleet, from the gardenio:agent_cost_usd:rate1h recording rule. This is the quantity DarkSpendOverThreshold evaluates.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 10 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "noValue": "pending dark-metric federation (empty ≠ $0) — ka-0000005942",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 10 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 25 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(gardenio:agent_cost_usd:rate1h{project=~\"$project\"})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active dark agents",
      "description": "Agents currently active in the selected fleet. Empty means gardenio_agents_active carries no series for this project — monorepo-dark is not yet federated into gardenio-vmsingle (ka-0000005942) — which is NOT the same as zero agents running. Mirrors the two spend tiles on this board; the previous `or vector(0)` painted a confident blue 0 that contradicted this board's own “empty is not $0” contract (ka-0000006531).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 10 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "pending dark-metric federation (empty ≠ 0 agents) — ka-0000005942",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(gardenio_agents_active{project=~\"$project\"})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Alert threshold (USD/hour)",
      "description": "The operator-set dark-spend guardrail (dashboard variable). Set it to the same USD/hour value as vmalert.gapAlerts.darkSpend.threshold to preview where DarkSpendOverThreshold fires.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 10 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "orange", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "vector($threshold)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Per-agent spend",
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "panels": [
        {
          "type": "timeseries",
          "title": "Spend rate by agent (USD/hour · real bill)",
          "description": "Top-15 agents by trailing-1h spend rate in the selected fleet (gardenio:agent_cost_usd:rate1h).",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "currencyUSD",
              "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "smooth", "fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
              "expr": "topk(15, sum by (agent) (gardenio:agent_cost_usd:rate1h{project=~\"$project\"}))",
              "legendFormat": "{{agent}}",
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "title": "Top spenders by agent (window · real bill)",
          "description": "Top-20 agents by billed LiteLLM spend over the dashboard time range, with role and model.",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 15 },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": { "custom": { "align": "auto", "filterable": true } },
            "overrides": [
              {
                "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Spend (USD)" },
                "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "currencyUSD" }, { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background" } }]
              }
            ]
          },
          "options": { "showHeader": true, "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Spend (USD)", "desc": true }] },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
              "expr": "topk(20, sum by (agent, role, model) (increase(gardenio_agent_spend_usd_total{project=~\"$project\"}[$__range])))",
              "format": "table",
              "instant": true,
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "transformations": [
            {
              "id": "organize",
              "options": {
                "excludeByName": { "Time": true },
                "renameByName": { "agent": "Agent", "role": "Role", "model": "Model", "Value": "Spend (USD)" }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Per-gardener spend",
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "panels": [
        {
          "type": "timeseries",
          "title": "Spend rate by gardener (USD/hour · real bill)",
          "description": "Top-15 gardeners (role matches gardener) by trailing-1h spend rate in the selected fleet.",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "currencyUSD",
              "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "smooth", "fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" }
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
              "expr": "topk(15, sum by (agent) (gardenio:agent_cost_usd:rate1h{project=~\"$project\", role=~\".*gardener.*\"}))",
              "legendFormat": "{{agent}}",
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "title": "Top gardeners by spend (window · real bill)",
          "description": "Top-20 gardeners by billed LiteLLM spend over the dashboard time range.",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": { "custom": { "align": "auto", "filterable": true } },
            "overrides": [
              {
                "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Spend (USD)" },
                "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "currencyUSD" }, { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background" } }]
              }
            ]
          },
          "options": { "showHeader": true, "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Spend (USD)", "desc": true }] },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
              "expr": "topk(20, sum by (agent, role) (increase(gardenio_agent_spend_usd_total{project=~\"$project\", role=~\".*gardener.*\"}[$__range])))",
              "format": "table",
              "instant": true,
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "transformations": [
            {
              "id": "organize",
              "options": {
                "excludeByName": { "Time": true },
                "renameByName": { "agent": "Gardener", "role": "Role", "Value": "Spend (USD)" }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Token usage & threshold",
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "panels": [
        {
          "type": "timeseries",
          "title": "Token usage over time (input / output / cache)",
          "description": "Live token counters for the selected fleet — the physical driver behind the dollar spend.",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "short",
              "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "smooth", "fillOpacity": 25, "lineWidth": 1, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } }
            },
            "overrides": [
              { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Input" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "blue", "mode": "fixed" } }] },
              { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Output" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed" } }] },
              { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Cache Read" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "purple", "mode": "fixed" } }] },
              { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Cache Write" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" } }] }
            ]
          },
          "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
          "targets": [
            { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum(gardenio_agent_input_tokens_current{project=~\"$project\"})", "legendFormat": "Input", "refId": "A" },
            { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum(gardenio_agent_output_tokens_current{project=~\"$project\"})", "legendFormat": "Output", "refId": "B" },
            { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum(gardenio_agent_cache_read_tokens_current{project=~\"$project\"})", "legendFormat": "Cache Read", "refId": "C" },
            { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum(gardenio_agent_cache_write_tokens_current{project=~\"$project\"})", "legendFormat": "Cache Write", "refId": "D" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "timeseries",
          "title": "Dark spend rate vs alert threshold (USD/hour · real bill)",
          "description": "Trailing-1h fleet spend rate against the operator-set threshold line. When the blue line crosses the red threshold, DarkSpendOverThreshold fires (after its `for` hold).",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 17 },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "currencyUSD",
              "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "smooth", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never" }
            },
            "overrides": [
              {
                "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Threshold" },
                "properties": [
                  { "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" } },
                  { "id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 0 },
                  { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [10, 10] } }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Dark spend rate" },
                "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "blue", "mode": "fixed" } }]
              }
            ]
          },
          "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
          "targets": [
            { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum(gardenio:agent_cost_usd:rate1h{project=~\"$project\"})", "legendFormat": "Dark spend rate", "refId": "A" },
            { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "vector($threshold)", "legendFormat": "Threshold", "refId": "B" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Spend distribution & gardener leaderboard",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Per-agent dark spend distribution — p50 / p90 / p95 (real bill)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 18 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "noValue": "dark spend not federated into vmsingle yet — empty is NOT $0 (see the header panel)"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "quantile(0.5, max by (agent) (gardenio_agent_spend_logs_usd{project=~\"$project\"}))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p50 agent"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "quantile(0.9, max by (agent) (gardenio_agent_spend_logs_usd{project=~\"$project\"}))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "p90 agent"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "quantile(0.95, max by (agent) (gardenio_agent_spend_logs_usd{project=~\"$project\"}))",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "p95 agent"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Distribution of per-agent billed spend across the dark fleet. The topk chart above names the loudest agents; this says whether they are outliers (p95 far above p50) or whether the whole fleet drifted up — the two need different responses."
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Gardener spend leaderboard (window · real bill)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 18 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "dark spend not federated into vmsingle yet — empty is NOT $0 (see the header panel)"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        },
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showUnfilled": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (agent) (increase(gardenio_agent_spend_usd_total{project=~\"$project\", role=~\".*gardener.*\"}[$__range])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{agent}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The same per-gardener window spend as the table below, ranked — for a handful of gardeners a bar is read in one glance where a table needs sorting."
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["gardenio", "cost", "dark", "spend"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "type": "datasource"
      },
      {
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "monorepo-dark", "value": "monorepo-dark" },
        "description": "Project-label regex this board scopes to (project=~), matching the DarkSpendOverThreshold vmalert's projectRegex. Default monorepo-dark = the autonomous dark universe. This is a LITERAL textbox, deliberately NOT a label_values query: a query var whose saved default is not a live option silently falls back to project=All and renders whole-fleet spend under a Dark title (ka-0000006486). Until dark-fleet metrics are federated into gardenio-vmsingle (ka-0000005942 / ka-0000005346) monorepo-dark matches no series and the panels read empty (pending federation) — empty is NOT $0. Widen to preview sibling scopes, e.g. monorepo-dark|gardenio.",
        "hide": 0,
        "name": "project",
        "query": "monorepo-dark",
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "type": "textbox"
      },
      {
